<title>NORWAY: Norway Seafoods says to restructure unit.</title>
<headline>Norway Seafoods says to restructure unit.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway Seafoods said it plans to restructure its Thorfisk unit because of rising commodity prices and unsatisfactory productivity, the Oslo stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Norway Seafoods said it was not known how many staff would be affected by the restructuring.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom (46 8 700 1004)</p>
